    "type": "game",
    "name": "Cascadia",
    "steam_appid": 2438970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438970/extras/8d35a72e1eb252e2390e23b4369e9e30.avif?t=1740002671\" /></span>Winner of the prestigious Spiel des Jahres board game award, <i>Cascadia</i> is a relaxing and strategic tile-laying game where wildlife and nature exist in beautiful balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438970/extras/15e5a8436cd69bbc2d49fe24a917096c.avif?t=1740002671\" /></span>Embark upon a breathtaking journey through the Pacific Northwest. Explore new habitats and discover the animals who live there as you compete to cultivate the perfect ecosystem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438970/extras/3a39b4b4ea6704e03a8916013457004d.avif?t=1740002671\" /></span><i>Cascadia</i>\u00a0<i>Digital </i>offers many new ways to play and explore, on your own or with friends:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo &amp; Online Play</strong> - Head out into the world to find your opponents, or go it alone!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Family Mode</strong> - Hone your skills in Family Mode with simpler scoring objectives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pass and Play</strong> - Share your field research with local pass-and-play!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 Solo Scenarios</strong> - Explore new approaches in unique scenarios!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 Challenges</strong> - Push yourself to complete tricky Challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Trek</strong> - Three challenges with specific objectives every day push your strategic abilities!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438970/extras/ea6af5ecf796d08d3a0be8716aa4cbba.avif?t=1740002671\" /></span><i>Cascadia</i>'s is easy to learn and hard to master.\u00a0 It\u2019s gameplay has won awards around the world. Here's how to play: </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >On your turn:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.) Select a <strong>Habitat</strong> tile and <strong>Wildlife</strong> token.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from one of the four combinations of tiles and tokens.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.) Place the tile and token into your <strong>Environment</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your Environment by placing your chosen Habitat tile adjacent to any other Habitat tile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Populate your Environment by placing your Wildlife token on any Habitat tile that can support that species of wildlife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a <strong>Nature</strong> token if you successfully populate a <strong>Keystone</strong> tile</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature tokens can be used to increase your options when selecting Habitat tiles and Wildlife tokens on subsequent turns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scoring:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points based on how harmonious your Environment is!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.) <strong>Habitats</strong>\u00a0- Score 1 point for each tile in your largest contiguous corridor of each habitat type. Also score bonuses for each type of habitat you have, if you have the largest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.) <strong>Wildlife</strong>\u00a0- Score points for your Wildlife based on the Wildlife Scoring Cards used in each game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.) <strong>Nature Tokens</strong>\u00a0- Score points for any unspent Nature Tokens earned from populating Keystone Tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438970/extras/b5136cc01730d843cf2987e096608f44.avif?t=1740002671\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438970/extras/8d35a72e1eb252e2390e23b4369e9e30.avif?t=1740002671\" /></span>Winner of the prestigious Spiel des Jahres board game award, <i>Cascadia</i> is a relaxing and strategic tile-laying game where wildlife and nature exist in beautiful balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438970/extras/15e5a8436cd69bbc2d49fe24a917096c.avif?t=1740002671\" /></span>Embark upon a breathtaking journey through the Pacific Northwest. Explore new habitats and discover the animals who live there as you compete to cultivate the perfect ecosystem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438970/extras/3a39b4b4ea6704e03a8916013457004d.avif?t=1740002671\" /></span><i>Cascadia</i>\u00a0<i>Digital </i>offers many new ways to play and explore, on your own or with friends:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo &amp; Online Play</strong> - Head out into the world to find your opponents, or go it alone!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Family Mode</strong> - Hone your skills in Family Mode with simpler scoring objectives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pass and Play</strong> - Share your field research with local pass-and-play!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 Solo Scenarios</strong> - Explore new approaches in unique scenarios!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 Challenges</strong> - Push yourself to complete tricky Challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Trek</strong> - Three challenges with specific objectives every day push your strategic abilities!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438970/extras/ea6af5ecf796d08d3a0be8716aa4cbba.avif?t=1740002671\" /></span><i>Cascadia</i>'s is easy to learn and hard to master.\u00a0 It\u2019s gameplay has won awards around the world. Here's how to play: </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >On your turn:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.) Select a <strong>Habitat</strong> tile and <strong>Wildlife</strong> token.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from one of the four combinations of tiles and tokens.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.) Place the tile and token into your <strong>Environment</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your Environment by placing your chosen Habitat tile adjacent to any other Habitat tile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Populate your Environment by placing your Wildlife token on any Habitat tile that can support that species of wildlife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a <strong>Nature</strong> token if you successfully populate a <strong>Keystone</strong> tile</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature tokens can be used to increase your options when selecting Habitat tiles and Wildlife tokens on subsequent turns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scoring:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points based on how harmonious your Environment is!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.) <strong>Habitats</strong>\u00a0- Score 1 point for each tile in your largest contiguous corridor of each habitat type. Also score bonuses for each type of habitat you have, if you have the largest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.) <strong>Wildlife</strong>\u00a0- Score points for your Wildlife based on the Wildlife Scoring Cards used in each game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.) <strong>Nature Tokens</strong>\u00a0- Score points for any unspent Nature Tokens earned from populating Keystone Tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438970/extras/b5136cc01730d843cf2987e096608f44.avif?t=1740002671\" /></span></p>",
